WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.094
Our fictional participant needs to prepare a service estimate.

00:00:04.094 --> 00:00:08.644
Begin with the saved offer, scope and selected guide format.

00:00:08.644 --> 00:00:12.283
Complete Person, Situation, Purpose, Result, Evidence and Boundary.

00:00:12.283 --> 00:00:19.107
The result is a draft estimate with supplied figures, listed exclusions and a checked subtotal.

00:00:19.107 --> 00:00:24.111
Evidence is the completed estimate and an explanation of the calculation.

00:00:24.111 --> 00:00:26.386
Finishing pages is not enough.

00:00:26.386 --> 00:00:30.935
Keep pricing advice and quote approval outside this fictional guide.

00:00:30.935 --> 00:00:35.484
For an internal resource, identify the team member and task.

00:00:35.484 --> 00:00:42.308
Reference the Lesson Three Point Four staff resource if it already teaches the same action.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:45.037
Keep source labels and open dependencies.

00:00:45.037 --> 00:00:53.681
The frame tells AI what the experience must help the person do; it does not prove real audience usefulness.
